  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(tree): stop Snapshot recursing on a repeated ancestor RuntimeId by @mmhh256 in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/429\n* fix(app): verify foreground window before reporting switch success by @xut1021 in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/430\n* chore(deps): bump the all-dependencies group with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/431\n* fix(input): reject malformed sign strings in _as_point coordinates by @rudratoshs in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/434\n* chore(deps): bump the all-dependencies group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/433\n* chore(deps): bump pyjwt from 2.13.0 to 2.14.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/435\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mmhh256 made their first contribution in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/429\n* @xut1021 made their first contribution in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/430\n* @rudratoshs made their first contribution in https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/pull/434\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP/compare/v0.8.6...v0.8.7",
